    130,
    556,
    145
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "6th 7th and 8th divisions are owned by Jupiter, Mars, the Sun, Venus, Mercury, the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    154,
    556,
    169
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Moon and the Lagna. This is why in the above Saturn's Ashtakavarga the order of ",
   "bbox": [
