    194
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "planets in the table is Saturn, Jupiter, Mars, the Sun, Venus, Mercury, the Moon ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    202,
    556,
    218
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and the Lagna. It will be seen that in Leo there are benefic bindus of Saturn, ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    226,
    556,
    242
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Jupiter, Mars, the Sun, Mercury and the Lagna. When Saturn in the course of his ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    251,
    556,
    266
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "transit passes through these divisions, benefic effects will be produced. There will ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    275,
    556,
    290
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "be adverse effects when Saturn passes through the division of Venus because his ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    299,
    556,
    314
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "division is deviod of benefic bindus",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    323,
    285,
    339
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the sense of the verses 16-19.",
   "bbox": [
