    327,
    363
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "20. The Sarvashtakavarga containing the results of Ashtakavargas of all the ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    371,
    556,
    387
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "planets is prepared by putting in each sign the sum total of all the figures in the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    395,
    556,
    411
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "seven Ashtakavargas. If a sign contains figures exceeding 28, the results of the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    420,
    556,
    435
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "transit in that sign will be auspicious. If the number of figures be less than 28, it ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    444,
    556,
    459
   ]
  },
  {
